Covers: stories260K.gguf in this directory.

This file was converted by this project from `stories260K/stories260K.bin` and
`stories260K/tok512.bin` of https://huggingface.co/karpathy/tinyllamas, whose
model card declares `license: mit`. The weights were trained with, and are
intended for, the llama2.c project (https://github.com/karpathy/llama2.c); the
notice below is that project's LICENSE file, reproduced verbatim. Conversion
changes the container format only — no weight is altered.

The chat template beside the model (stories260K.chat-template.jinja) is not
covered by this notice: it is this project's own file and carries this
repository's licence.

